sions\n\n- Reproducible in v4.5.beta3.official [4d1f26e1f], v4.5.beta2.official [e1b4101e3], v4.5.beta1.official [46c495ca2]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.beta1 - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.6094) - AMD Ryzen 5 3600 6-Core Processor (12 threads) - 31.93 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nEngine crashes when accepting an autocomplete suggestion for a base class with custom documentation.\n\n```gdscript\n## Sets up level\n@abstract func start_level()\n\n## Go back to the map\n@abstract func end_level() \n\n```\n\nWhen autocompleting the function in the inherited class, the documentation comment will be visible in the autocomplete popup:\n\n<img width=\"361\" height=\"214\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a232878e-84af-4798-ac90-ac381ec16791\" />\n\n\nSee the attached reproduction project and steps.\n\n```\n================================================================\nCrashHandlerException: Program crashed with signal 4\nEngine version: Godot Engine v4.5.beta3.official (4d1f26e1fd1fa46f2223fe0b6ac300744bf79b88)\nDumping the backtrace. Please include this when reporting the bug on: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues\n[1] error(-1): no debug info in PE/COFF executable\n[2] error(-1): no debug info in PE/COFF executable\n[3] error(-1): no debug info in PE/COFF executable\n[4] error(-1): no debug info in PE/COFF executable\n[5] error(-1): no debug info in PE/COFF executable\n[6] error(-1): no debug info in PE/COFF executable\n[7] error(-1): no debug info in PE/COFF executable\n[8] error(-1): no debug info in PE/COFF executable\n[9] error(-1): no debug info in PE/COFF executable\n[10] error(-1): no debug info in PE/COFF executable\n[11] error(-1): no debug info in PE/COFF executable\n[12] error(-1): no debug info in PE/COFF executable\n[13] error(-1): no debug info in PE/COFF executable\n[14] error(-1): no debug info in PE/COFF executable\n[15] error(-1): no debug info in PE/COFF executable\n[16] error(-1): no debug info in PE/COFF executable\n[17] error(-1): no debug info in PE/COFF executable\n[18] error(-1): no debug info in PE/COFF executable\n[19] error(-1): no debug info in PE/COFF executable\n[20] error(-1): no debug info in PE/COFF executable\n[21] error(-1): no debug info in PE/COFF executable\n[22] error(-1): no debug info in PE/COFF executable\n-- END OF C++ BACKTRACE --\n================================================================\n\n```\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create an abstract script, add a couple of abstract functions with custom documentation (## comments)\n2. Create a new scene\n3. Attach a script to that scene, extend the abstract class\n4. Start writing the abstract function name, \n5. Wait for autocomplete to suggest the name, press enter or tab to accept\n6. The engine crashes\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[abstract-class-crash.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21239975/abstract-class-crash.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev","html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"